From e6cacab5b40205de95c98f283fdc5fd5fab7be4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Murashov <ivan.murashov@lge.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Jun 2024 22:46:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [v8][build] Restore GN use_gold logic in V8

:Release Notes:
Restored GN use_gold logic in V8 to fix compiler error when use_lld=false
after rolling to 127.0.6483.0~1

:Detailed Notes:
In the upstream CL https://crrev.com/c/5538290 was rolled V8, where was
integrated CL https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/5528990,
where removed references to `use_gold` GN variable.

Previously we restored main use_gold logic in the Neva change
http://mercury.lge.net:8080/c/11222.
In this change restored use_gold logic for V8 component.

Without this change builds fails with the following error:
FAILED: v8_context_snapshot.bin
python3 ../../build/gn_run_binary.py ./v8_context_snapshot_generator --output_file=v8_context_snapshot.bin
#
# Fatal error in , line 0
# Check failed: table->address(index) == table->address(encoded_index).
#
#
#
#FailureMessage Object: 0x7fff1f5dd030#0 0x55a83a504f12 base::debug::CollectStackTrace()
#1 0x55a83a4ff67e base::debug::StackTrace::StackTrace()
#2 0x55a83a4887ad gin::(anonymous namespace)::PrintStackTrace()
#3 0x55a83a7aee3e V8_Fatal()
#4 0x55a838bd8499 v8::internal::StartupDeserializer::DeserializeIntoIsolate()
#5 0x55a83866f14d v8::internal::Isolate::Init()
#6 0x55a83866f659 v8::internal::Isolate::InitWithSnapshot()
#7 0x55a838bcbc9f v8::internal::Snapshot::Initialize()
#8 0x55a838bce72d v8::internal::SnapshotCreatorImpl::SnapshotCreatorImpl()
#9 0x55a8384d2b40 v8::SnapshotCreator::SnapshotCreator()
#10 0x55a83d53297f gin::IsolateHolder::IsolateHolder()
#11 0x55a83d5326f3 gin::IsolateHolder::IsolateHolder()
#12 0x55a83c291ed2 blink::V8PerIsolateData::V8PerIsolateData()
#13 0x55a83c292860 blink::V8PerIsolateData::Initialize()
#14 0x55a83b45ea38 blink::V8Initializer::InitializeMainThread()
